odotengine/godot/pulls/111901","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111901","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111901.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111901.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-23T20:37:11Z"},"body":"- Supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/57678\r\n\r\nChanges default Go to Line shortcut to Ctrl+G (except on macOS)\r\n\r\nThis is for consistency with other IDEs. VSCode, Rider, Kate, and Sublime Text all use Ctrl+G for Go to Line.\r\n\r\nOn macOS it is sometimes Cmd+G, but it seems like it is Cmd+L is more common, so I added an override for it to keep the same shortcut as before.\r\nBut I can change it here too if we want.\r\n\r\n`editor/group_selected_nodes` also uses Ctrl+G, but it didn't work when the Script Editor was open anyway, and it still works in the 2D/3D editors now.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111901/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":